OL,3,GNEWSAThe Dales community living with   
OL,4,Achemical contamination fears           
OL,6,FPeople living in a remote Yorkshire    
OL,7,FDales community have appealed for more 
OL,8,Fsupport, two years after discovering   
OL,9,Fparts of their town were contaminated  
OL,10,Fwith high levels of chemicals linked to
OL,11,Fcancer.                                
OL,13,FFirefighting foam made with PFAS - a   
OL,14,Fgroup of so-called "forever chemicals" 
OL,15,F- was manufactured and tested in       
OL,16,FBentham in North Yorkshire for many    
OL,17,Fyears.                                 
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
