OL,3,GNEWSAThe Dales community living with   
OL,4,Achemical contamination fears           
OL,6,FBlood tests revealed some residents had
OL,7,Fhigh concentrations of PFAS - including
OL,8,F79-year-old Lindsay Young, who was     
OL,9,Fplaced in the highest risk category and
OL,10,Fis calling for her wider family to be  
OL,11,Ftested, saying "we have to tackle      
OL,12,Fthis".                                 
OL,14,FAngus Fire, the company that made the  
OL,15,Ffoams in Bentham, said it had spent #6m
OL,16,Ftrying to identify and remove the      
OL,17,Flegacy contamination.                  
